lithify implements ideas from:

  Xu, R., Chen, Y., CuiZhu, Z., Dalvi Mishra, B., Ming, Y., Yu, H., Han, R., Lee, C.-Y.,
  and Pfister, T. "Harness²: Recursive Agent Harnessing for an Open World."
  arXiv:2610.14224, 2026. https://github.com/google-research/harness2

The role prompts in src/lithify/prompts/ follow the structure of that paper's stage prompts
(Appendix H) and were rewritten for software repositories with deterministic gates. lithify
contains no code from the Harness² repository. lithify is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Google.
